title: "GH-1553: investigate history union scalar replay refusal on concurrent appends"
description: "External report from pm-web using pm-cli 2026.10.19: history merge refuses scalar rebase when main closes an item and a branch appends comments/field edits. Reproduce on current SDK before changing the fail-closed replay contract; a manually unioned stream passing health alone is not proof that event semantics are lossless."
